/**
 * The app, in French.
 *
 * Keyed on the ENGLISH source string, exactly as i18n.ts's German table is,
 * because that is what ui() is handed at the call site. One character out and
 * the lookup misses in silence: the app draws the English and nothing
 * anywhere reports a problem. So this file is generated from the German
 * table's own keys rather than typed, and check-french-interface fails the
 * build if the two ever hold different keys.
 *
 * It sits in its own file because i18n.ts is three thousand lines before it
 * arrives, and because a table is data. The last few entries are German, not
 * English — those are the fallbacks uiOr() is given at its call sites, which
 * have no English key to be found under.
 */
